### PVC Rate Management

Create two completely separate rate systems:

A. Individual Rate Slabs

Initial sample slabs, editable by Admin:

- 1 Card = ₹80
- 2–3 Cards = ₹77.50 per card
- 4–6 Cards = ₹75 per card
- 7–9 Cards = ₹72.50 per card
- 10–13 Cards = ₹70 per card
- 14–16 Cards = ₹67.50 per card

Admin can edit, delete, add, activate or deactivate all slabs.

B. Wholesale Rate Slabs

- No default wholesale rate.
- No hardcoded wholesale quantity slab.
- Admin will manually create all wholesale slabs.
- Admin can add unlimited slabs.
- Each slab includes minimum quantity, maximum quantity and per-card rate.
- Slabs must not overlap.
- If no applicable slab exists, do not automatically calculate a guessed rate.

### PVC Order Calculation

Line Total = Quantity × Applicable Per-Card Rate

Grand Total = Sum of All Line Totals

Remaining Due = Grand Total − Advance − Additional Payments

Support multiple payments for one order.

